    (property "Note" "Toshiba TPHR8504PL, 40 V / 0.7 mOhm / 150 A, 2-5W1A SOP Advance(N) [49]. Replaces IRFB4110PBF [20]. 40 V against a 25.2 V pack is 1.59x, down from 3.97x -- accepted for the 5.7x conduction-loss improvement; drain overshoot MUST be bounded via the DRV8353S IDRIVE setting and bench-measured before fab (TODO.md)." (at 902.39 140 0)
