    (property "Note" "C_VCORE for U1 (MSPM0G3518-Q1). REQUIRED value: 470nF nominal between VCORE and VSS per [44] p.51 SS7.3, low-ESR, tolerance +/-20% or better, placed as close to the VCORE pin as possible. This net carries the cap and nothing else -- [44] p.51 note (2) forbids supplying any voltage or applying any external load to VCORE. Repurposed 2026-08-10 from the S32K144 VDDA decoupling cap; the MSPM0 has no VDDA pin." (at 589.85 162.54 0)
