      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    )
    (property "Note" "Through-hole pin header -> bare SMD solder pads 2026-08-16. On this double-sided 30x60 board a THT part blocks BOTH sides: 9 THT parts occupied 482 mm^2 but consumed 964 mm^2 of the 3600 mm^2 budget, which is what stopped the layout converging. Precedent: the S50 [47] specifies 'CAN Port Connector: Solder PAD' and carries no headers. TRADE, flagged per AGENTS.md Sec.4: no mechanical retention -- a soldered wire relies on the joint alone. Acceptable for J1 (debug). J2/J3 leave the board in service and need strain relief from a tie-down, potting, or a real connector chosen later. See TODO.md." (at 219.85 62.54 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    )
    (pin "1" (uuid ee92bed3-c8b4-4878-81d4-36b89f7e450e))
